{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS (Magic: The Gathering set) card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`, filling in the `card_impl.py` template (currently `pass` stubs) for each. The class names are predetermined and the class MUST remain in `cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py`:\n   - **SOS 1 — TheDawningArchaic** (Creature, subtypes {'Avatar'}, LEGENDARY, base_power 7/base_toughness 7, `{10}`, keyword Reach): \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard. Reach. Whenever The Dawning Archaic attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n   - **SOS 4 — TogetherAsOne** (Sorcery, `{6}`, Converge): \"Converge — Target player draws X cards, Together as One deals X damage to any target, and you gain X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.\"\n   - **SOS 13 — EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares** (Creature, subtypes {'Cat','Cleric'}, LEGENDARY, 3/3, `{1}{W}{W}`, keyword Prepared): \"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared. (While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell — Swords to Plowshares {W}: Exile target creature, controller gains life = its power. Doing so unprepares it.)\"\n   - **SOS 57 — ManaSculpt** (Instant, `{1}{U}{U}`): \"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n   - **SOS 97 — RalZarekGuestLecturer** (Planeswalker, subtypes {'Ral'}, LEGENDARY, starting_loyalty 3, `{1}{B}{B}`): +1 Surveil 2; −1 any number of target players each discard a card; −2 return target creature card MV≤3 from your graveyard to battlefield; −7 flip five coins, target opponent skips their next X turns (X = heads).\n   - **SOS 120 — ImprovisationCapstone** (Sorcery — subtypes {'Lesson'}, `{5}{R}{R}`, Paradigm): \"Exile cards from top of library until total MV ≥ 4; you may cast any number of them without paying mana costs. Paradigm.\"\n   - **SOS 201 — LoreholdTheHistorian** (Creature — subtypes {'Elder','Dragon'}, LEGENDARY, 5/5, `{3}{R}{W}`, keywords Flying+Haste): \"Flying, haste. Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}. At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\"\n   - **SOS 226 — SilverquillTheDisputant** (Creature — subtypes {'Elder','Dragon'}, LEGENDARY, 4/4, `{2}{W}{B}`, keywords Flying+Vigilance): \"Flying, vigilance. Each instant and sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1.\"\n   - **SOS 245 — WitherbloomTheBalancer** (Creature — subtypes {'Elder','Dragon'}, LEGENDARY, 5/5, `{6}{B}{G}`, keywords Deathtouch+Flying): \"Affinity for creatures (self). Flying, deathtouch. Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures.\"\n   - **SOS 257 — GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex** (Land, mana_cost empty): \"{T}: Add {C}. {T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color (spend only to cast instant/sorcery). {5}: If not a creature, becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.' Still a land.\"\n   The user expects engine changes to implement new keywords/mechanics (\"The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior\"), and to write per-card tests at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (max 30 tests per card). Use completed FDN cards as examples; refer to RULEBOOK.txt for deep rules.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Pure-Python (stdlib only) MTG rules engine, imported as `engine`. Bare package imports from workspace root (e.g., `from cards.sos.sos_1.card_impl import TheDawningArchaic`).\n   - CardImpl hooks: `can_cast(game)`, `cost_reduction(game)->int` (generic-only, clamped ≥0), `on_cast(game)`, `on_resolve(game)` (targets via `self.chosen_targets`), `get_targets(game)->list[TargetRequirement]`, `register_triggers(game)`, `register_replacement_effects(game)`, `get_activated_abilities()->list[ActivatedAbility]`, `get_modes()`. Planeswalker: `get_loyalty_abilities()->list[LoyaltyAbility]`. Land: `get_mana_abilities()->list[ManaAbility]`, `can_cast()->False`.\n   - Triggers: `TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)`; `fire_event(game, event)` matches isinstance (subclass-aware), checks condition `(game,event)->bool`, pushes `StackObject(source, controller, on_resolve=trigger.effect)` in APNAP order. CRITICAL LIMITATION: effect receives only `(game)`, not the event.\n   - Replacement effects: `ReplacementEffect(event_type, source, condition, replacement, controller)`; \"instead\" semantics; only consulted on battlefield-leave moves in move_to_zone.\n   - Continuous effects: `EffectManager.add(ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, timestamp, duration))`; 7-layer system; `DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0`, `DURATION_PERMANENT=-1`; `apply_all` resets battlefield via `_reset_characteristics()` then reapplies; cleanup removes EOT effects.\n   - Mana: `ManaPool.last_payment_colors` (distinct Colors, colorless excluded, sorted). `cast_spell` sets `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)`. Converge color count = `len(set(colors_spent))`. NO record of total mana spent exists.\n   - `cast_spell(game, player, card)` (timing+mana) and `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` (no timing/mana, casts from any zone).\n   - `game.extra_turns: list[int]` FIFO of seat indices for inserted extra turns. NO skip-turn support exists.\n   - DeterministicPlayer pops scripted answers; test_utils.cast_spell scripts targets via `player._script.appendleft(target)` for each target reversed.\n   - Loyalty activation: `engine/abilities.py` `activate_ability` → `_activate_loyalty_ability` (sorcery speed, once-per-turn via module `_loyalty_activated_this_turn`, pays loyalty, pushes StackObject with on_resolve=ability.effect). FDN cards' loyalty effects read targets via `getattr(pw, '_resolve_target', None)` (test backdoor).\n   - move_to_zone fires EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent BEFORE calling the entering card's `register_triggers` — so a card's OWN ETB trigger registered via register_triggers will NOT self-fire. Established pattern for own-ETB is to put logic in `on_resolve` (called in `_resolve_spell` before move_to_zone, while card is still in STACK zone).\n   - copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets) shallow-copies source for spell copies (used for casualty).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` — Read fully. `cast_spell`: timing→can_cast→hand→move to STACK zone→`del card.colors_spent` if present→choose targets→protection check→`if card.controller is None: card.controller=player`→`reduction=get_cost_reduction(...)`→`effective_cost=_apply_cost_reduction(...)`→`player.mana_pool.pay(effective_cost)`→`card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)`→`card.on_cast(game)`→build StackObject with `_on_resolve` calling `_resolve_spell`→`game.stack.push(stack_obj)`. Does NOT fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent. `cast_spell_free` similar, no mana/timing, finds card in any player's `from_zone`. `get_cost_reduction(game, card, controller)`: temporarily sets card.controller, calls `card.cost_reduction(game)`, restores, clamps `max(0, min(raw, generic))`. `_resolve_spell` sets `card.chosen_targets = stack_obj.targets` then `card.on_resolve(game)` then moves permanent→battlefield or nonpermanent→graveyard. EDIT NEEDED: fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent after push; record `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc`; sum battlefield `static_cost_reduction` in get_cost_reduction.\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py` — Read fully. `declare_attackers_step` taps attackers (unless VIGILANCE), sets is_attacking; does NOT fire AttacksTriggeredEvent. EDIT NEEDED: fire AttacksTriggeredEvent per attacker.\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py` — Read fully. SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller); AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker); EndStepTriggeredEvent(player); BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent (no fields — cannot tell whose upkeep, must read game.active_player). EDIT NEEDED: add MainPhaseBeganTriggeredEvent(player) for Mana Sculpt.\n   - `/workspace/engine/triggers.py` — Read fully. `fire_event` builds `StackObject(source=trigger.source, controller=trigger.controller, on_resolve=trigger.effect)`. EDIT NEEDED (planned): wrap effect to pass event when effect accepts 2 params (inspect-based, backward-compatible) for casualty/miracle.\n   - `/workspace/engine/card.py` — Read fully. CardImpl base; Creature has base_power/base_toughness/modified_power/modified_toughness/`power`/`toughness` properties/plus_one_counters; `_reset_characteristics` resets card_types/keywords (Creature also P/T, counters, `_cant_attack`/`_cant_block`/`_cant_be_blocked`/`_cant_activate`/`_max_attackers_blocked`/protections). Dataclasses: Mode, ActivatedAbility(cost, effect, description), LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description), ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description), ContinuousEffect(apply, remove, description). EDIT NEEDED (planned): add `static_cost_reduction(self, game, spell, controller)->int` returning 0.\n   - `/workspace/engine/zones.py` — Read fully. move_zone deletes `colors_spent` on zone change. move_to_zone: replacement consult (battlefield-leave only), fires LeavesBattlefield then CreatureDies (if creature→graveyard) BEFORE unregister; on entering battlefield fires ETB BEFORE register_triggers/register_replacement_effects.\n   - `/workspace/engine/stack.py` — Read fully. StackObject(source, controller, targets, on_resolve, is_mana_ability). copy_spell shallow-copies source. priority_loop resolves LIFO.\n   - `/workspace/engine/types.py` — Read fully. Keyword flags (FLYING, FIRST_STRIKE, DOUBLE_STRIKE, DEATHTOUCH, TRAMPLE, LIFELINK, VIGILANCE, REACH, HASTE, FLASH, DEFENDER, HEXPROOF, INDESTRUCTIBLE, MENACE, WARD, PROWESS — NO Converge/Casualty/Miracle/Affinity/Prepared/Paradigm/Surveil keywords). ManaCost.parse, ManaCost.cmc (X treated as 0). TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone).\n   - `/workspace/engine/player.py` — Read fully. DeterministicPlayer._pop / _script (deque); remaining_choices property.\n   - `/workspace/engine/game.py` — Read fully. Helpers: deal_damage, destroy, sacrifice, exile, draw_card (increments cards_drawn_this_turn — created lazily, never reset in this file), discard, create_token, add_counter (supports \"+1/+1\",\"-1/-1\",\"loyalty\", generic), remove_counter, tap, untap.\n   - `/workspace/engine/mana.py` — Read fully. ManaPool.add/empty/total/get; pay computes last_payment_colors.\n   - `/workspace/engine/turn.py` — Read fully. UPKEEP fires BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent(). END step (Phase.ENDING, Step.END) has NO handler. `_NO_PRIORITY_STEPS={(BEGINNING,UNTAP),(ENDING,CLEANUP)}`. EDIT NEEDED (planned): fire MainPhaseBeganTriggeredEvent at PRECOMBAT_MAIN/POSTCOMBAT_MAIN; optionally fire EndStepTriggeredEvent at END.\n   - `/workspace/engine/game_state.py` — Read fully. advance_phase wrap branch pops extra_turns else uses _normal_next_index. EDIT NEEDED (planned): add `self.skip_turns: dict[int,int]={}` and skip logic.\n   - `/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py`, `/workspace/engine/replacement_effects.py` — Read fully (standard managers).\n   - `/workspace/engine/abilities.py` — Read fully (activation harness, loyalty tracking).\n   - `/workspace/test_utils.py` — Read fully. create_game, set_board_state, cast_spell (auto sorcery-speed setup, scripts targets reversed v