{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Verbatim task (from prompt.md, still in effect): \"Implement the following SOS cards: 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257 in `/workspace/cards/sos/`. Each card directory contains a `card_spec.json` with the card's details and a `card_impl.py` template to fill in. Use the completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as implementation examples. Refer to `RULEBOOK.txt` for the full deep-reference rules text. For engine API discovery, read the source modules directly... You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior. Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n   Also required: write per-card tests at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (≤30 tests each) and run the full suite (`python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ cards/ -q` or `/usr/local/bin/pytest`; `python` is NOT available — use `python3`).\n   Engine modifications MUST be additive-only: \"You may add new methods, classes, helpers, and files inside `engine/`. You may modify the bodies of existing functions... You MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything that already exists in `engine/`.\" Card class names are predetermined and MUST remain in `cards/sos/{card_id}/card_impl.py`. Baseline: `pytest engine_tests/ -q` → 1145 passed.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Pure-Python (stdlib only) MTG engine; flat imports from /workspace (conftest adds it to sys.path). `python3` only.\n   - CardImpl hooks: can_cast(game)->bool; cost_reduction(game)->int (generic-only, clamped ≥0, self-reduction); static_cost_reduction(game, spell, controller)->int (summed across ALL battlefield permanents in get_cost_reduction, skipping `perm is card`); on_cast(game); on_resolve(game) (targets via self.chosen_targets); get_targets(game)->list[TargetRequirement]; register_triggers(game); register_replacement_effects(game); get_activated_abilities()->list[ActivatedAbility]; get_modes(). Planeswalker.get_loyalty_abilities()->list[LoyaltyAbility]. Land.can_cast→False, get_mana_abilities()->list[ManaAbility].\n   - card.py dataclasses: ActivatedAbility(cost, effect, description); LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description); ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description); ContinuousEffect (NOTE: card.py also defines a DIFFERENT ContinuousEffect(apply, remove, description) — DO NOT use it; use engine.continuous_effects.ContinuousEffect); Mode(name, description).\n   - abilities.py runtime: ActivatedAbilityInstance(source, controller, cost:(game,source)->bool, effect:(game)->None, is_mana_ability=False, description=\"\"); LoyaltyAbilityInstance(source, controller, loyalty_cost=0, effect, description=\"\"). activate_ability(game, player, ability): mana abilities call effect(game) immediately; regular push StackObject(on_resolve=effect); loyalty requires is_sorcery_speed + once-per-turn (`_loyalty_activated_this_turn` keyed by (object_id, turn_number)), pays loyalty (AbilityError if new<0), pushes StackObject; `_cant_activate` blocks regular abilities. tap_cost(game, source)->bool taps if untapped. clear_loyalty_tracking() resets.\n   - Targeting: spells read self.chosen_targets (set by _resolve_spell from StackObject.targets). Helper `_get_chosen_target(card, game)`: returns chosen_targets[0] else getattr(card,\"_resolve_target\",None). Activated abilities read source._current_target (fdn_95). Loyalty read getattr(pw,\"_resolve_target\",None) (fdn_44); I will add pw._resolve_targets (list) for Ral −1. cast_spell scripts targets via player.choose_target popping; filter_fn validated; TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone) — zone is NOT used for DeterministicPlayer selection (it just pops scripted), so zone can be a placeholder (e.g. Zone.BATTLEFIELD) even for player targets.\n   - Triggers: TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition:(game,event)->bool|None, effect, source, controller). fire_event matches isinstance (subclass-aware), pushes StackObject APNAP-ordered. fire_event WRAPS effects accepting ≥2 positional params (or VAR_POSITIONAL) to call effect(game, event); 1-arg effects called effect(game). unregister(source) identity-based; only auto-called when leaving battlefield in move_to_zone (NOT for stack/exile/graveyard sources — so a trigger registered with source = a card in exile or a sentinel persists).\n   - Events: SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell=StackObject, player, card, controller) fired AFTER pushing the spell's StackObject (so cast triggers resolve ABOVE/before the spell); AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker) fired in declare_attackers_step (combat.py:270); BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent (NO fields — determine whose upkeep via game.active_player); EndStepTriggeredEvent(player); MainPhaseBeganTriggeredEvent(player) fired for BOTH main phases (distinguish via game.phase==Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN); DrawsCardTriggeredEvent(player, card) fired AFTER incrementing player.cards_drawn_this_turn (so first card of turn ⇒ cards_drawn_this_turn==1); EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent; CreatureDiesTriggeredEvent; DealsDamageTriggeredEvent(source, target, amount, is_combat, combat); LosesLife/GainsLife/CounterAdded events.\n   - move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone, *, replacement_event=None): fires ETB BEFORE register_triggers (own ETB won't self-fire — put own-ETB logic in on_resolve). create_token same ordering. _resolve_spell runs card.on_resolve while card is on STACK, then moves permanents → battlefield, non-permanents → graveyard OR exile if getattr(card,\"_exile_instead_of_graveyard\",False) (this flag branch already added to casting.py). Replacement effects only consulted when leaving battlefield AND replacement_event supplied.\n   - Continuous effects: engine.continuous_effects.ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply:(game)->None, timestamp=0, duration). Layer.TYPE=4, ABILITY=6, POWER_TOUGHNESS=7; SubLayer.SET_PT=\"7b\", MODIFY_PT=\"7c\"; DURATION_PERMANENT=-1, DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0. game.effect_manager.add(effect). apply_all resets battlefield via _reset_characteristics (CardImpl: card_types→_original_card_types frozenset, keywords→_original_keywords; subtypes NOT reset; Creature also resets modified_power/toughness→base and counters→_base_*) then applies sorted by (layer, sublayer-order, timestamp). Modify P/T via obj.modified_power += N. apply_all only iterates BATTLEFIELD objects. remove_expired sweeps EOT effects. Land has no P/T attributes by default → animation must re-add CREATURE type each cycle (TYPE-layer permanent effect) and the card must supply P/T attrs.\n   - Mana: ManaPool.add(ManaType, n), can_pay(cost), pay(cost) sets last_payment_colors (distinct Colors, colorless excluded, sorted by Color.value). cast_spell sets card.colors_spent=list(last_payment_colors) and card.mana_spent=pool_before-pool_after. cast_spell_free sets card.mana_spent=0. ManaCost.cmc treats X as 0, hybrid +1 each. ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{U}{U}\"). ManaCost() is empty (generic 0). move_zone deletes stale colors_spent on any zone change. No gain_life helper — use player.life += x.\n   - cast_spell (timing+mana, from hand, fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent after push). cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone) (no timing/mana, finds card in any player's from_zone, rolls back to source on target failure, fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent). copy_spell(game, original_stackobj, controller, new_targets=None) shallow-copies source, binds on_resolve to copied_card.on_resolve (no zone movement); push it onto game.stack. _counter_spell pattern (fdn_153): remove StackObject from game.stack._items, remove card from controller STACK zone, add to owner GRAVEYARD.\n   - game.extra_turns (FIFO seat indices); game.skip_turns dict[int,int] keyed by seat (decremented/honored in _next_active_player_index). game.players.index(player) gives seat.\n   - DeterministicPlayer pops scripted answers (deque.popleft) for choose/choose_target/choose_yes_no/choose_card/assign_damage_order; ScriptExhaustedError when empty. ALWAYS guard player choices in card code with try/except (ScriptExhaustedError, NotImplementedError). test_utils.cast_spell scripts targets via player._script.appendleft(target) reversed; auto-resolves via _resolve_top_of_stack (pops+on_resolve each). declare_attackers scripts active._script.appendleft(attackers_list); declare_blockers scripts defending._script.appendleft(block_map). set_board_state(game, idx, battlefield=, hand=, graveyard=, life=, mana={ManaType:n}).\n   - protection.py reads obj.colors (list of single-letter strings) for protection checks; safe/expected to set self.colors after super().__init__ (matches sos_stubs.py pattern: e.g. self.colors=['W']).\n   - SOS stubs subclass proper base (Creature/Instant/Sorcery/Planeswalker/Land) — set name/mana_cost/subtypes/supertypes/base_power/base_toughness via kwargs.setdefault and add self.colors. NO registration function. Library top = last element; library.top(n) returns last n.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` — CONFIRMED intact (Task #13 done): _resolve_spell non-permanent branch uses `dest = Zone.EXILE if getattr(card,\"_exile_instead_of_graveyard\",False) else Zone.GRAVEYARD`. get_cost_reduction sums static_cost_reduction over battlefield (skip `perm is card`) then `return max(0, min(raw, generic))`. cast_spell sets colors_spent/mana_spent; both cast funcs fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent.\n   - `/workspace/engine/card.py` — CONFIRMED: CardImpl(_original_card_types frozenset, _original_keywords, _reset_characteristics resets card_types+keywords only); static_cost_reduction default 0. Creature(base_power/base_toughness/modified_power/modified_toughness, power/toughness properties = modified ± counters, summoning_sick default True, _reset_characteristics resets P/T+counters+_cant_* flags). Land.can_cast→False, get_mana_abilities→[]. Planeswalker.starting_loyalty/loyalty, get_loyalty_abilities→[].\n   - `/workspace/engine/triggers.py`, `events.py`, `turn.py`, `game_state.py`, `combat.py`, `game.py`, `abilities.py`, `stack.py`, `mana.py`, `continuous_effects.py`, `zones.py`, `player.py`, `types.py` — all READ this session; prior edits confirmed intact (event wrapping helper, MainPhaseBeganTriggeredEvent fired for both mains with player=active_player, EndStep firing, AttacksTriggeredEvent firing, skip_turns honored).\n   - FDN reference cards READ: fdn_6 (Instant; cost_reduction affinity-for-Cats; on_resolve adds POWER_TOUGHNESS/MODIFY_PT EOT ContinuousEffect, +2/+2 via modified_power+=2). fdn_205 WardensOfTheCycle (Creature; `self.colors_spent:int=0`; on_resolve count=self.colors_spent → create_token loop). fdn_153 EssenceScatter (Instant; _get_chosen_target, _counter_spell using game.stack._items, can_cast scans game.stack.objects() excluding self, get_targets TargetRequirement zone=Zone.STACK). fdn_44 KaitoCunningInfiltrator (Planeswalker; register_triggers via TriggerRegistration; get_loyalty_abilities returns LoyaltyAbility list; reads getattr(pw,'_resolve_target',None); emblem via `type('Emblem',(),{'name':...})()`). fdn_95 SowerOfChaos (Creature; get_activated_abilities returns ActivatedAbility(cost=_cost(game,src) pays mana, effect reads source._current_target)). fdn_157 LightshellDuo (surveil 2 on_resolve: top_cards=cards[-min(2,len):], for card in reversed → choose_yes_no → move to graveyard). fdn_28 VanguardSeraph (register_triggers GainsLifeTriggeredEvent + per-turn gu