if isinstance(cs,int) else len(cs)`.\n   - SOS 257 Land animation challenge: must NOT set base_power until animated (else non-creature land becomes attack-eligible since declare_attackers filters `hasattr(c,'base_power')`); plan to add creature attrs + _is_animated flag only on animate, define power/toughness properties with getattr defaults, override _reset_characteristics to reset P/T only when animated, animate via permanent TYPE-layer ContinuousEffect re-adding {CREATURE} + 'Wizard'.\n   - Pending: confirm exact ManaAbility activation/test interface — found FDN lands (fdn_272 Plains line 22, fdn_267 SecludedCourtyard line 64, fdn_254 line 34, fdn_227 line 37) and engine_tests/test_abilities.py + test_card.py use get_mana_abilities/ManaAbility, but those FDN land files were NOT yet read (immediate next step).\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - System reminders re-supplying prior Read results for game_state.py, turn.py, events.py, triggers.py, and the deferred-tools/ToolSearch note.\n   - \"Continue the conversation from where it left off... Pick up the last task as if the break never happened. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary...\"\n   - Recurring task-list reminders (Tasks #1–#13; #13 completed, #1 in_progress, #2–#12 pending).\n   - Final CRITICAL instruction: \"Respond with TEXT ONLY. Do NOT call any tools... Your task is to create a detailed summary of the conversation so far...\"\n   - Preserved constraints (verbatim, still in effect): \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\" Additive-only: \"You may add new methods, classes, helpers, and files inside `engine/`. You may modify the bodies of existing functions... You MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything that already exists in `engine/